hadiths[115]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sawal kiya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham samandar ka safar karte hain aur apne sath thoda pani rakhte hain, agar ham us pani se wuzu karen to pyase rah jaenge. To kya ham samandar ke pani se wuzu kar liya karen? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us ka pani pak hai aur us ka murdar halal hai.'"
"2","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sawal kiya aur kaha: Beshak Bi'r Buza'ah mein kutton ke murdar aur haiz wale kapde phenke jate hain. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Pani ko koi cheez napak nahin karti.'"
"3","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi thehre hue pani mein peshab na kare, phir us mein se ghusl kare.'"
"4","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abdullah bin Umar se, apne walid (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab pani do qulle ho to woh najasat ya gandagi ko qabool nahin karta.'"
"5","[AI-translation] Aisi sanad se jise main yaad nahin rakhta ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab pani do qulle ho to woh najasat ko qabool nahin karta.' Aur is hadees mein hai: 'Hajar ke qullon se.' Ibn Juraij ne kaha: Main ne Hajar ke qulle dekhe hain, ek qulla do mashkizon ya do mashkizon se kuch zyada ki gunjaish rakhta hai."
"6","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap se poocha gaya: Kya ham gadhon ke bache hue se wuzu karen? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Han, aur tamam darindon ke bache hue se bhi.'"
"7","[AI-translation] Humaidah bint Ubaid bin Rifa'ah se, Kabshah bint Ka'b bin Malik se aur woh Ibn Abi Qatadah ya Abu Qatadah ki biwi thin, shak Rabi' ki taraf se hai, ke Abu Qatadah andar aae to unhon ne in ke liye wuzu ka pani dala. Phir ek billi aai aur us mein se pi liya. Unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne mujhe use dekhte hue dekha to farmaya: Kya tu ta'ajjub karti hai aey mere bhai ki beti? Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh napak nahin hai, woh tum mein phirne walon mein se hai.'"
"8","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein piye to use saat martaba dhoe.'"
"9","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein munh dale to use saat martaba dhoe.'"
"10","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein munh dale to use saat martaba dhoe, jin mein pahli ya aakhri mitti se ho.'"
"11","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qadah se ghusl farmate the aur woh faraq hai, aur main Aap ke sath ek hi pani se ghusl karti thi."
"12","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek hi bartan se ghusl karti thi."
"13","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek hi bartan se ghusl karte aur kabhi main Aap se kahti: Mere liye chhor den, mere liye chhor den."
"14","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se, Maimunah se riwayat hai ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek hi bartan se ghusl karti thin."
"15","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein mard aur aurten ikatthe wuzu karte the."
"16","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha jab namaz asr ka waqt ho gaya, aur logon ne wuzu ka pani talash kiya magar use na paya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas wuzu ka pani laya gaya, to Aap ne us bartan mein apna hath rakha aur logon ko hukm diya ke us se wuzu karen. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne pani ko Aap ki ungliyon ke neeche se phoot-te dekha, phir logon ne wuzu kiya yahan tak ke un sab ne aakhir tak wuzu kar liya."
"17","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek murda bakri ke paas se guzre jo Aap ne Maimunah zauja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki aazad karda londi ko di thi. Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum ne is ki khal se kyun faida nahin uthaya?' Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Yeh to murdar hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Sirf is ka khana haram kiya gaya hai.'"
"18","[AI-translation] Ibn Wa'lah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko suna, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo bhi khal dabaghat di jae to woh pak ho jati hai.'"
"19","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Sauban se, apni walida se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke murdar ki khalon se faida uthaya jae jab unhen dabaghat de di jae."
"20","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo chandi ke bartanon mein peeta hai woh apne pet mein jahannam ki aag hi ghatahta hai.'"
"21","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati ne masjid mein peshab kiya to log us ki taraf jaldi se badhe, to Aap ne unhen is se mana farmaya aur farmaya: 'Us par pani ka ek dol baha do.'"
"22","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati masjid mein dakhil hua aur kaha: Aey Allah! Mujh par aur Muhammad par raham kar aur hamare sath kisi par raham na kar. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tune wasee ko tang kar diya.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir thodi der baad us ne masjid ke ek kinare mein peshab kiya aur goya woh us ki taraf jaldi se badhe. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen mana farmaya phir pani ke ek dol ya bade dol ka hukm diya jo us par baha diya gaya. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Sikhao aur aasani karo aur sakhti na karo.'"
"23","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke kapde se mani khurachti thi."
"24","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke kapde se mani khurachti thi."
"25","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke kapde se mani khurachti thi phir Aap us mein namaz padhte."
"26","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se kapde ko lagne wali mani ke bare mein riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ise apne se door kar do, un mein se ek ne kaha: Lakdi ya izkhir ghaas se, kyunke woh thook ya naak ki rail ki manind hai."
"27","[AI-translation] Mus'ab bin Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke jab in ke kapde ko mani lagti to agar tar hoti to use ponchh lete aur agar khushk hoti to use khurachte, phir us mein namaz padhte."
"28","[AI-translation] Asma se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kapde ko lagne wale haiz ke khoon ke bare mein poocha to Aap ne farmaya: 'Use khuracho, phir pani se mal kar ragdo, phir pani chhidko aur us mein namaz padho.'"
"29","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apni biwi Fatimah bint Munzir ko kahte suna: Main ne apni dadi Asma bint Abi Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kahte suna: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se haiz ke khoon ke bare mein poocha, phir unhon ne isi ki misl zikr ki."
"30","[AI-translation] Fatimah bint Munzir se, Asma bint Abi Bakr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sawal kiya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ka kya khayal hai ke ham mein se kisi ke kapde ko haiz ka khoon lag jae to woh kya kare? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ke kapde ko haiz ka khoon lag jae to use mal kar ragde phir pani se dhoe, phir us mein namaz padhe.'"
"31","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Rafi' se, Umm Salamah zauja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se us kapde ke bare mein poocha gaya jise haiz ka khoon lag jae to Aap ne farmaya: 'Use khuracho, phir pani se mal kar ragdo, phir us mein namaz padho.'"
"32","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf ki umm walad se, Umm Salamah se riwayat hai ke ek aurat ne Umm Salamah se sawal kiya aur kaha: Main ek aisi aurat hun jo apna daman lamba rakhti hun aur gandi jagah par chalti hun. To Umm Salamah ne farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us ke baad wali mitti use pak kar deti hai.'"
"33","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main tumhare liye walid ki manind hun. Jab tum mein se koi qazae hajat ke liye jae to qible ki taraf munh na kare aur na peeth kare, aur teen pathron se istinja kare.' Aur Aap ne gobar aur haddi se aur aadmi ke daen hath se istinja karne se mana farmaya."
"34","[AI-translation] Umarah bin Khuzaimah bin Sabit se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne istinja ke bare mein farmaya: 'Teen pathron se jin mein gobar na ho.'"
"35","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne qible ki taraf pakhane ya peshab ke liye munh karne se mana farmaya, lekin mashriq ya maghrib ki taraf karo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir ham Sham aae to ham ne baitulkhala qible ki taraf bane hue pae to ham hat gae aur Allah Ta'ala se maghfirat mangi."
"36","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Log kahte hain ke jab tum apni hajat ke liye baitho to qible aur Baitul Maqdis ki taraf munh na karo. Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: Main apne ghar ki chhat par chadha to main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko do eenton par Baitul Maqdis ki taraf munh kiye apni hajat ke liye dekha."
"37","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas se guzra jabke Aap peshab kar rahe the, to us ne Aap ko salam kaha. To Aap ne us ke salam ka jawab diya. Jab woh aage badh gaya to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use pukara aur farmaya: Mujhe tumhare salam ka jawab dene par sirf is khadshe ne ubhara ke tum chale jaoge aur kahoge: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko salam kaha magar Aap ne mujhe jawab nahin diya. Jab tum mujhe is haalat mein dekho to mujhe salam na kaho, agar tum ne aisa kiya to main tumhen jawab nahin dunga."
"38","[AI-translation] A'raj se, Ibn Simmah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas se guzra jabke Aap peshab kar rahe the, to main ne Aap ko salam kaha magar Aap ne mujhe jawab nahin diya, yahan tak ke Aap deewar ki taraf khade hue aur use us lakdi se kureda jo Aap ke paas thi, phir apna hath deewar par rakha aur apne chehre aur bazuaon ka masah kiya, phir mujhe salam ka jawab diya. Asamm ne kaha: Yeh donon hadeesen kitab wuzu mein nahin hain, lekin main ne unhen yahan nikala kyunke kitab wuzu mein in ki jagah yahin hai."
"39","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne kaha: Aur Abu Huwairis ne A'raj se, Abu Simmah se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne peshab kiya phir tayammum kiya. To main ne is wajah se hadees ko mukammal nikala."
"40","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Bi'r Jamal ki taraf apni hajat ke liye tashreef le gae, phir tashreef lae to ek aadmi ne Aap ko salam kaha magar Aap ne use jawab nahin diya, yahan tak ke apna hath deewar se ponchha phir use salam ka jawab diya."
"41","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi apni neend se jage to apna hath bartan mein na duboe yahan tak ke use teen martaba dho le, kyunke woh nahin janta ke us ka hath kahan raha.'"
"42","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi apni neend se jage to apne hath ko apne wuzu mein dakhil karne se pahle dho le, kyunke tum mein se koi nahin janta ke us ka hath kahan raha.'"
"43","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi apni neend se jage to apne hath ko apne wuzu mein dakhil karne se pahle dho le, kyunke tum mein se koi nahin janta ke us ka hath kahan raha.'"
"44","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi apni neend se jage to apne hath ko apne wuzu mein dakhil karne se pahle dho le, kyunke woh nahin janta ke us ka hath kahan raha.' Asamm ne kaha: Main ne Malik ki hadees alag nikali aur Sufyan ki hadees alag, kyunke Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne is se pahle use donon se mil kar Malik ki hadees ke alfaz par zikr kiya tha."
"45","[AI-translation] Amr bin Yahya Mazini se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Zaid Ansari se kaha: Kya aap mujhe dikha sakte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kis tarah wuzu karte the? To Abdullah bin Zaid ne farmaya: Han. Phir unhon ne wuzu ka pani mangwaya, phir apne donon hathon par dala aur donon hathon ko do martaba dhoya, aur kulli ki aur naak mein teen martaba pani dala, phir apne chehre ko teen martaba dhoya, phir apne donon hathon ko kuhniyon tak do do martaba dhoya, phir apne sar ka donon hathon se masah kiya: Un donon ko aage lae aur peeche le gae, apne sar ke agle hisse se shuru kiya, phir un donon ko apni gudi tak le gae, phir un donon ko us jagah wapas lae jahan se shuru kiya tha, phir apne donon paon dhoe."
"46","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zaid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wuzu kiya: Apne chehre ko teen martaba dhoya, donon hathon ko do do martaba, aur apne sar ka donon hathon se masah kiya: Un donon ko aage lae aur peeche le gae, apne sar ke agle hisse se shuru kiya, phir un donon ko apni gudi tak le gae, phir un donon ko us jagah wapas lae jahan se shuru kiya tha, phir apne donon paon dhoe."
"47","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wuzu kiya: Apna hath bartan mein dakhil kiya, phir naak mein pani dala aur kulli ki ek martaba, phir apna hath dakhil kiya aur apne chehre par ek martaba dala aur apne donon hathon par ek martaba dala, aur apne sar aur donon kanon ka ek martaba masah kiya."
"48","[AI-translation] Mughirah bin Shu'bah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wuzu kiya phir apni peshani, apne amame aur apne donon mozon ka masah kiya."
"49","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wuzu kiya phir amama hataya aur apne sar ke agle hisse ka ya farmaya apni peshani ka pani se masah kiya."
"50","[AI-translation] Ibn Sirin se, Mughirah bin Shu'bah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni peshani ka ya farmaya apne sar ke agle hisse ka pani se masah kiya."
"51","[AI-translation] Asim bin Laqit bin Sabirah se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Banu Muntafiq ka wafd tha ya Banu Muntafiq ke wafd mein tha, phir ham Aap ke paas aae magar ham ne Aap ko na paya, aur ham ne Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ko paya. To unhon ne hamen qina' mein khajooren din jo tabaaq hai aur hamare liye khazeerah banane ka hukm diya to banaya gaya. Phir ham ne khaya. Thodi der baad Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tashreef lae to farmaya: 'Kya tum ne kuch khaya? Kya tumhare liye kuch ka hukm diya gaya?' To ham ne kaha: Han. Thodi der baad charwahe ne apni bakriyan hankin to ek bakri chillai. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Aey falan! Us ne kya jana?' Us ne kaha: Ek memna. Aap ne farmaya: 'Hamare liye is ki jagah ek bakri zibah karo.' Phir Aap meri taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Yeh hargiz na samajhna ke ham ne use tumhari wajah se zibah kiya. Hamari sau bakriyan hain jin ke badhne ka ham irada nahin rakhte, jab charwaha memna janta hai to ham is ki jagah ek bakri zibah kar dete hain. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri biwi ki zaban mein kuch hai yani badkalami hai. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Use talaq de do.' Main ne kaha: Meri us se aulad hai aur us ki suhbat hai. Aap ne farmaya: To use hukm do yani use naseehat karo, agar us mein bhalai hui to woh qabool karegi, aur apni biwi ko apni londi ko marne ki tarah na maro. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe wuzu ke bare mein khabar den. Aap ne farmaya: 'Wuzu poora karo, ungliyon ka khilal karo, aur naak mein pani dalne mein mubalagha karo siwae is ke ke tum rozedar ho.'"
"52","[AI-translation] Salim Sablan Maula Nasriyeen se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) zauja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Makkah ki taraf nikle, aur woh mere walid ke sath nikla karti thin yahan tak ke woh unhen namaz padhate. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr ke paas wuzu ka pani laya gaya. To Aishah zauja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Abdur Rahman! Wuzu poora karo, kyunke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Aediyon ke liye aag ka azaab hai qayamat ke din.'"
"53","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abdur Rahman se farmaya: Aey Abdur Rahman! Wuzu poora karo, kyunke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Aediyon ke liye aag ka azaab hai.'"
"54","[AI-translation] Humran se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne baithne ki jagah par teen teen martaba wuzu kiya, phir farmaya: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo mere is wuzu ki tarah wuzu kare to us ki khatayen us ke chehre, hathon aur paon se nikal jati hain.'"
"55","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar mujhe apni ummat par mashaqqat ka khauf na hota to main unhen Isha moakhar karne aur har namaz ke sath miswak ka hukm deta.'"
"56","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Miswak munh ko pak karne wali aur Rab ki khushnudi ka zariya hai.'"
"57","[AI-translation] Urwah bin Zubair se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Marwan bin Hakam ke paas gaya to ham ne muzakarah kiya ke kis cheez se wuzu wajib hota hai. To Marwan ne kaha: Zakar ko chhoone se wuzu wajib hai. Urwah ne kaha: Mujhe is ka ilm nahin. Marwan ne kaha: Mujhe Busrah bint Safwan ne khabar di ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna Aap farma rahe the: 'Jab tum mein se koi apne zakar ko chhue to woh wuzu kare.'"
"58","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Abi Sa'id se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi apni sharmgah ko hath lagae jabke darmiyan mein kuch bhi na ho to woh wuzu kare.'"
"59","[AI-translation] Uqbah bin Abdur Rahman se, Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Sauban se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi apne zakar ko hath lagae to woh wuzu kare.' Aur Ibn Nafi' ne izafa kiya: Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Sauban se, Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl. Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Main ne huffaz mein se ek se zyada ko use riwayat karte suna jo us mein Jabir ka zikr nahin karte."
"60","[AI-translation] Mujhe Qasim bin Abdullah ne khabar di goya Ubaidullah bin Umar se, Qasim bin Muhammad se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, unhon ne kaha: Jab aurat apni sharmgah ko hath lagae to woh wuzu kare."
"61","[AI-translation] Salim se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Khawand ka biwi ko bosa dena, aur is ko hath lagana yeh chhoone ke amal se hai, lehaza jis ne apni biwi ko bosa diya ya use hath lagaya to is par wuzu lazim hai."
"62","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Miqdad bin Aswad se riwayat hai ke Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhen kaha ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is aadmi ke mutalliq poochhen jo apni biwi ke qareeb jata hai to is ki mazi nikalti hai, woh kya kare? Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Mere han Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki beti hai, mujhe sawal karte hue haya aati hai. Miqdad (Raziyallahu anhu) kahte hain main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is bare mein poocha to Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi yeh kaifiyat pae to woh apni sharmgah par pani chhidke aur namaz jaisa wuzu kar le.'"
"63","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke jab unhen nakseer phootti to woh namaz se nikalte, wuzu karte aur baghair baat kiye wapas aa jate."
"64","[AI-translation] Salim se, Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne farmaya: 'Jis ki nakseer phooti ya jis ne nakseer ya mazi ya qai pai to woh wapas mud kar wuzu kare aur phir usi jagah se aa kar namaz shuru kare.'"
"65","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Tamim se, apne chacha Abdullah bin Zaid se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se arz kiya gaya ke agar kisi aadmi ko namaz mein be wuzu hone ka khayal guzre to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh jab tak awaz na sun le ya bu na pa le to woh wapas na mude.'"
"66","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) farmate hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba namaz isha ka intezar karte, ghalba neend ki wajah se baithe hue in ke sar jhuk jate magar woh azsar nau wuzu kiye baghair namaz padh lete."
"67","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke woh baithe hue so jate, phir namaz padhte aur wuzu nahin karte the."
"68","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne farmaya: 'Jo lait kar soya is par wuzu wajib ho gaya aur jo baitha so gaya is par wuzu nahin hai.'"
"69","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Amr bin Umayyah Zamri se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bakri ke kandhe ka gosht khaya aur azsar nau wuzu kiye baghair namaz padhi."
"70","[AI-translation] Ibn Shihab se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz mein hansne wale aadmi ko wuzu aur namaz lautane ka hukm diya. Magar yeh qabool nahin kiya gaya, kyunke yeh mursal hai."
"71","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Arqam se, Hasan se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is hadees ki misl riwayat hai."
"72","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam se, Ata bin Yasar se, Usamah bin Zaid se riwayat hai, farmate hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Bilal (Raziyallahu anhu) dakhil hue aur kisi zaroorat ke liye gae, phir donon bahar aae to Usamah kahte hain main ne Bilal (Raziyallahu anhu) se poocha: Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kya kiya? To Bilal (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Aap qazae hajat ke liye tashreef le gae, phir wuzu kiya to apne chehre aur hathon ko dhoya, apne sar ka masah kiya, aur mozon par bhi masah kiya."
"73","[AI-translation] Urwah bin Mughirah se riwayat hai ke unhen Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ghazwa Tabuk mein shareek hue the. Mughirah farmate hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) fajr se pahle bol o baraz ke liye tashreef le gae aur main ne Aap ke sath fajr se pahle pani ka bartan uthaya hua tha. Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wapas aae to main Aap ke hathon par bartan se pani dalne laga, Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne hathon ko teen martaba dhoya, phir apna chehra dhoya, phir apne bazuon se jubba hatane lage lekin jubbe ki aasteenen tang ho gaen to Aap ne apne hath jubba mein dakhil kiye yahan tak ke apne bazuaon ko jubbe ke neeche se nikala, aur apne bazuon ko kuhniyon samet dhoya, phir wuzu kiya aur mozon par masah kiya, phir wapas aae. Mughirah kahte hain: Main bhi Aap ke sath wapas muda, ham ne dekha ke log Abdul Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ki iqtida mein namaz padh rahe hain, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek rak'at jama'at ke sath padhi aur doosri rak'at logon ke sath alag padhi. Jab Abdul Rahman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne salam phaira to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade ho gae aur apni namaz mukammal ki. Is waqea ne Musalmanon ko pareshan kar diya aur woh kasrat se Subhan Allah kahne lage. Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz mukammal ki to Sahaba ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: 'Tum ne achcha kiya' ya farmaya 'Tum ne durust kiya.' Goya Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) in ko namaz waqt par padhne ki targheeb dila rahe the."
"74","[AI-translation] Ibn Shihab ne kaha: Aur mujhe Ismail bin Muhammad bin Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas ne, Hamzah bin Mughirah se Abbad ki hadees ki misl bayan ki. Mughirah ne kaha: To main ne Abdul Rahman ko peeche hatane ka irada kiya to mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ise rahne de.'"
"75","[AI-translation] Sha'bi se, Urwah bin Mughirah se, Mughirah bin Shu'bah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Aey Allah ke Rasool! Kya ham mozon par masah kar sakte hain? Aap ne farmaya: 'Han, jabke tum ne in ko wuzu ki haalat mein pahna ho.'"
"76","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Ziyad se aur woh Mughirah bin Shu'bah ki aulad mein se hain, Mughirah bin Shu'bah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghazwa Tabuk ke mauqe par qazae hajat ke liye tashreef le gae, phir baad mein Aap ne wuzu kiya aur mozon par masah kiya aur namaz padhi."
"77","[AI-translation] Nafi' aur Abdullah bin Dinar se riwayat hai ke jab Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Kufa tashreef le gae, is waqt Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (Raziyallahu anhu) wahan ke governor the, unhon ne dekha ke Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) mozon par masah karte hain to Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne in par etiraz kiya. Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Apne baap se pooch lena.' Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne poocha to Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Jab tu paon mein moze wuzu ki haalat mein pahne to in par masah kar.' Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne poocha: 'Agar ham bol o baraz ke liye jaen to?' Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Agarcha bol o baraz ke liye jao to bhi masah karo.'"
"78","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne bazar mein peshab kiya, phir wuzu kiya aur mozon par masah kiya, phir namaz padhi."
"79","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Abdur Rahman bin Ruqaish kahte hain: Main ne Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) ko dekha, woh Quba mein aae, peshab kiya aur wuzu kiya to mozon par masah kiya aur baad mein namaz padhi."
"80","[AI-translation] Ibn Abd Khair se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne wuzu karte hue paon ke upar wale hisse par masah kiya aur farmaya: 'Agar main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko paon ke upar wale hisse par masah karte hue na dekha hota to mere khayal ke mutabiq nichla hissa zyada behtar hai ke is par masah kiya jae.'"
"81","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne bazar mein wuzu kiya, apne chehre aur hathon ko dhoya, phir apne sar ka masah kiya, phir unhen janaza ke liye bulaya gaya, woh masjid mein namaz janaza padhne ke liye dakhil hue to mozon par masah kiya, phir namaz janaza padhi."
"82","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne bazar mein peshab kiya aur apne chehre aur hathon ko dhoya, phir apne sar ka masah kiya, phir masjid mein dakhil hue, woh janaza ke liye bulaye gae to Aap ne mozon par masah kiya aur namaz janaza padhi."
"83","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakrah se, apne walid se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne musafir ko teen din aur teen raton tak mozon par masah karne ki rukhsat di, aur muqeem ko ek din aur ek raat."
"84","[AI-translation] Zirr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Safwan bin Assal Muradi (Raziyallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to unhon ne kaha: 'Kis kaam se aae ho?' Kahte hain main ne kaha: 'Husool ilm ke liye.' To unhon ne farmaya: 'Farishte talib ilm ki raza ke liye apne par bichhate hain.' Main ne kaha: 'Bol o baraz ke baad mozon par masah karne ke bare mein mere dil mein kuch shak guzarta hai jabke Aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahabiyon mein se hain. Main Aap se yeh poochne aaya hun ke kya Aap ne is bare mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kuch suna hai?' Safwan bin Assal (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Han! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab ham safar mein hote ya musafir hote to hamen hukm dete ke ham janabat ke baghair apne mozon ko teen din aur teen raton tak na utaren lekin bol o baraz aur neend ke baad moze utarne ki zaroorat nahin.'"
"85","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai farmati hain, ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek safar mein the ke mera haar toot gaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is ko dhoondne ke liye thahar gae, jabke qafila walon ke paas pani nahin tha to tayammum ki aayat nazil hui."
"86","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ammar bin Yasir (Raziyallahu anhu) farmate hain ke ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath kandhon tak tayammum kiya."
"87","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ammar bin Yasir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, farmate hain: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar mein the to tayammum ki aayat nazil hui, ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath kandhon tak tayammum kiya."
"88","[AI-translation] Ibn Simmah (Raziyallahu anhu) riwayat karte hain, farmaya: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas se guzra Aap peshab kar rahe the, Aap ne deewar ko hath lagaae phir chehre aur bazuon ka tayammum kiya."
"89","[AI-translation] Ibn Simmah (Raziyallahu anhu) riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tayammum mein apne chehre aur hath ka masah kiya."
"90","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh Jurf maqam se aae hatta ke jab woh baade ke paas aae to tayammum kiya, apne chehre aur hathon ko chhua, aur namaz asr ada ki, phir Madinah mein dakhil hue jabke suraj buland tha aur Aap ne namaz nahin lautai."
"91","[AI-translation] Nafi' se marvi hai ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne chopayon ke baade ke paas tayammum kiya aur namaz asr ada ki, phir Madinah mein dakhil hue jabke suraj buland tha lekin namaz dobara nahin padhi."
"92","[AI-translation] Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne junbi aadmi ko hukm diya ke woh tayammum kare, phir woh namaz padh le, jab pani dastiyab ho to woh ghusl kare. Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) se marvi hadees mein hai: 'Jab tumhen pani mil jae to is se ghusl karle.'"
"93","[AI-translation] Ummul Momineen Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Umm Sulaim (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur arz kiya: 'Ya Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Allah Ta'ala haq bayan karne se haya nahin karta, kya aurat ko jab ehtelam ho jae to is par ghusl farz hai?' Farmaya: 'Han! Jab woh pani dekhe.'"
"94","[AI-translation] Zubaid bin Salt se riwayat hai woh bayan karte hain ke main Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath Jurf ki taraf gaya, unhon ne dekha ke woh to ehtelam se hain aur ghusl kiye baghair namaz padh li hai, to farmaya: 'Allah ki qasam mujhe nahin maloom ke main ehtelam se hun aur main ne ghusl bhi nahin kiya aur namaz padh li hai.' Zubaid kahte hain unhon ne ghusl kiya aur kapde ko jahan mani nazar aa rahi thi is jagah se dhoya aur jahan se nahin dikhai deti thi pani chhidak diya, azan aur iqamat kahi phir suraj ke buland ho jane ke baad namaz padhi."
"95","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se riwayat hai ke Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) Ummul Momineen Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas aae aur kaha: 'Mujh par Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba ka ikhtilaf ek aise mas'ala mein giran ho chuka hai jis ko main bada janta hun ke Aap ke samne rakhun.' Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: 'Woh kya mas'ala hai? Jis ke bare mein tu apni maa se sawal nahin karna chahta, mujh se poochho!' To Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se kaha: 'Ek aadmi apni biwi ke paas jata hai aur woh inzal se qabl door ho jata hai.' Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: 'Jab khatna, khatna se tajawuz kar jae to ghusl wajib ho jata hai.' Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Main Aap ke baad kisi se is mas'ala mein kabhi bhi sawal na karunga.'"
"96","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se riwayat hai ke Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se do khatnon ke milne ke bare mein sawal kiya to Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab do khatne mil jaen ya khatna khatne ko chhu le, to ghusl wajib ho gaya.'"
"97","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, farmati hain Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi chaar shakhan ke darmiyan baitha, phir us ne uzw makhsoos ko aurat ki sharm gah se milaya, to is par ghusl wajib ho gaya.'"
"98","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, farmati hain: Jab do khatne mil jaen to ghusl wajib ho jata hai. Main ne aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh amal kiya aur baad mein ham ne ghusl kiya."
"99","[AI-translation] Ubayy bin Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai bayan karte hain, main ne arz kiya: 'Ya Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Jab ham mein se koi jima' kare aur nuzool se qabl farigh ho jae to kya kare?' To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo hissa aurat ko laga hai is ko dho le phir wuzu kar ke phir namaz padh le.'"
"100","[AI-translation] Ubayy bin Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) se marvi hai ke woh kaha karte the ke jis ne inzal nahin kiya is par ghusl nahin, phir Ubayy bin Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) ne wafaat se qabl is baat se ruju' kar liya tha."
"101","[AI-translation] Ubayy bin Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya ke shuru Islam mein pani ka istemal khurooj pani se tha, phir baad mein is ko chhod diya gaya, aur mahz sharmgahon ke milap se ghusl ka hukm de diya gaya."
"102","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se marvi hai farmate hain, main ne kaha: 'Ya Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Mere maa baap Aap par qurban, beshak mera baap faut ho gaya hai.' Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jao use zameen mein daba aao.' Main ne kaha: 'Woh haalat shirk mein mara hai.' Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jao use zameen mein daba aao.' Main is ko zameen mein daba kar Aap ki khidmat mein hazir hua to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jao aur ghusl karo.'"
"103","[AI-translation] Ummul Momineen Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab ghusl janabat karte to pahle hath dhote, phir namaz ke wuzu ki tarah wuzu karte, phir apni ungliyon ko pani mein dakhil karte aur in se apne balon ki jadon ka khilal karte, phir apne hathon se teen chullu bhar kar sar par dalte, phir apne sare jism par pani bahate."
"104","[AI-translation] Ummul Momineen Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai bayan karti hain, jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghusl janabat ka irada karte to bartan mein hath dalne se pahle in ko dhote phir apni sharmgah ko dhote, phir namaz ke wuzu ki tarah wuzu karte, phir pani se apne balon ko tar karte, phir apne sar par teen chullu pani dalte."
"105","[AI-translation] Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) riwayat karte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne sar par teen chullu pani dalte jabke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) junbi hote."
"106","[AI-translation] Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai woh bayan karti hain ke main ne poocha: 'Ya Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)! Main apne sar ke balon ki mendhiyan banati hun, kya ghusl janabat ke mauqe par unhen kholun?' Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Nahin, bas tere liye yahi kafi hai ke tu teen chullu pani baha diya kar, phir apne baqi jism par pani baha le to pak ho jaegi.'"
"107","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai bayan karti hain, ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se haiz se ghusl ke mutalliq poocha. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kastoori lagi hui roi le aur is se paki hasil kar.' Is aurat ne kaha: 'Is se kis tarah paki hasil karun?' Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is se paki hasil kar.' Us ne kaha: 'Kis tarah is se paki hasil karun?' Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Subhan Allah! Subhan Allah!' Aur kapde se parda kar liya, 'Is se paki hasil kar.' Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) farmati hain main ne is ko apni taraf khainch liya aur main jaan gai ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kya chahte hain, phir main ne use kaha: 'Use khoon lagi jagah par phair le.'"
"108","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwi Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ek aurat ko bahut zyada khoon aata tha, is ke liye Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mas'ala poocha to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is marz istihaza se pahle jitni raaten aur din use haiz aaya karta tha in ka andaz laga kar utne din mahine mein namazen chhod de, jab woh waqt guzar jae to ghusl kare, phir kapda bandh kar namaz padh le.'"
"109","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) bayan karti hain ke Fatimah bint Abi Hubaish ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: 'Main pak nahin rah sakti, kya main namaz chhod dun?' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh to ek rag hai yeh haiz nahin, jab haiz ke din aaen to namaz padhna chhod do, jab woh din khatm ho jaen to apne jism se khoon ko saaf karo aur namaz padho.'"
"110","[AI-translation] Imran bin Talhah se, apni walida Hamnah bint Jahsh se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe bahut zyada shadeed istihaza ka khoon aata tha. To main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas fatwa poochne aai aur Aap ko apni bahan Zainab ke ghar paya. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe Aap se ek kaam hai, aur yeh aisi baat hai jis se chhutkara nahin aur mujhe is se haya aati hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh kya hai aey hantah?' Unhon ne kaha: Main ek aisi aurat hun jise bahut zyada shadeed istihaza aata hai, is ke bare mein Aap kya farmate hain? Us ne mujhe namaz aur roze se rok diya hai? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main tere liye roi tajweez karta hun kyunke woh khoon ko jazb karti hai.' Unhon ne kaha: Woh is se zyada hai. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Langoat bandh lo.' Unhon ne kaha: Woh is se bhi zyada hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Kapda le lo.' Unhon ne kaha: Woh is se bhi zyada hai, main to dharaen baha rahi hun. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main tumhen do baton ka hukm dunga, in mein se jo bhi kar lo gi woh doosri se kifayat karegi, aur agar tum donon par qudrat rakhti ho to tum zyada janti ho.' Aap ne un se farmaya: 'Yeh shaitan ki thokaron mein se ek thokar hai. Allah Ta'ala ke ilm ke mutabiq chhe ya saat din haiz mein raho, phir ghusl karo yahan tak ke jab tum dekho ke tum pak ho gai ho aur bilkul saaf ho gai ho to chaubees raat din ya taees raat din namaz padho, aur roza rakho, kyunke yeh tumhen kifayat karega. Aur isi tarah har mahine karo jaise aurten apne haiz aur tuhr ke waqt par haiz mein rahti hain aur pak hoti hain.'"
"111","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwi Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ek aurat ko bahut zyada khoon aata tha, is ke liye Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mas'ala poocha to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is marz istihaza se pahle mahine mein jitni raaten aur din use haiz aata tha is ka khayal kar ke mahine mein utne din namaz chhod de, jab woh waqt guzar jae to ghusl kar ke kapda bandh le aur namaz padhe.'"
"112","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Umm Habibah bint Jahsh (Raziyallahu anha) saat saal istihaza ki mareez rahin, unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha to Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh ek rag hai, haiz nahin.' Aur use hukm diya ke woh ghusl kar ke namaz padhe, chunanche woh har namaz ke liye ghusl kartin, woh ghusl ke liye tub mein baitthin thin to khoon ki surkhi pani par aa jati."
"113","[AI-translation] Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne farmaya: 'Aurat ke haiz ki muddat teen, chaar se le kar dus tak hai.' Shafi'i ne farmaya: Aur mujhe Ibn Ulaiyah ne kaha: Jald dehati Arab hai jo hadees nahin janta."
"114","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai aur unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath haalat ehram mein hone ka zikr kiya ke woh is dauran haiza ho gaen to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne in ko hukm diya ke woh pak hone tak Baitullah ke tawaf aur namaz ke ilawa woh tamam kaam karen jo haji karte hain."
"115","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai woh bayan farmati hain, main Makkah aai jabke main haiza thi, main ne na Baitullah ka tawaf kiya aur na hi Safa Marwah ki sa'i ki, main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is bare mein poocha to Aap ne farmaya: 'Pak hone tak Baitullah ke tawaf ke ilawa jo hajj karne wale kar rahe hain tu bhi kar.'"
